    "### What is a TCN?\n",
    "\n",
    "Temporal Convolutional Networks apply causal, dilated convolutions to capture temporal patterns with a long effective receptive field.\n",
    "For our monthly time series, TCNs use stacked dilated conv blocks to extract:\n",
    "- **Seasonal patterns** (e.g., rainy vs dry seasons)\n",
    "- **Local trends** (e.g., temperature peaks during growing season)\n",
    "- **Multi-scale features** through increasing dilations\n",
    "\n",
    "**Why TCN for crop yield?**\n",
    "- Efficient at capturing temporal patterns (monthly sequences)\n",
    "- Fewer parameters than recurrent networks\n",
    "- Captures seasonal signatures while keeping receptive field wide"
   ]
